    },
    {
      "text": "Make the muffins by combining almond flour, erythritol, protein powder, baking powder, cinnamon, and salt.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-coffee-cake-muffins/#wprm-recipe-54579-step-0-1",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/Keto-Coffee-Cake-Muffins-2.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Whisk to combine all of the ingredients together.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-coffee-cake-muffins/#wprm-recipe-54579-step-0-2",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/Keto-Coffee-Cake-Muffins-3.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add the unsweetened almond milk, melted butter, vanilla extract, and eggs.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-coffee-cake-muffins/#wprm-recipe-54579-step-0-3",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/Keto-Coffee-Cake-Muffins-4.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Whisk to combine all of this together.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-coffee-cake-muffins/#wprm-recipe-54579-step-0-4",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/Keto-Coffee-Cake-Muffins-5.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Line a muffin pan with muffin liners and pour the muffin mixture into the liners.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-coffee-cake-muffins/#wprm-recipe-54579-step-0-5",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/Keto-Coffee-Cake-Muffins-6.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Create the crumble by combining the almond flour, erythritol, protein powder, and cinnamon. Whisk to combine.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-coffee-cake-muffins/#wprm-recipe-54579-step-0-6",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/Keto-Coffee-Cake-Muffins-7.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add in the melted butter.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-coffee-cake-muffins/#wprm-recipe-54579-step-0-7",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/Keto-Coffee-Cake-Muffins-8.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Whisk until the mixture begins to get crumbly.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-coffee-cake-muffins/#wprm-recipe-54579-step-0-8",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/Keto-Coffee-Cake-Muffins-9.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Sprinkle this crumble evenly on top of the muffins. Bake in the oven for about 30 minutes or until a toothpick inserted comes out clean. Let cool completely.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-coffee-cake-muffins/#wprm-recipe-54579-step-0-9",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/Keto-Coffee-Cake-Muffins-10.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Make the drizzle by combining powdered erythritol, heavy cream, and vanilla extract into a bowl. Whisk to combine well.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-coffee-cake-muffins/#wprm-recipe-54579-step-0-10",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/Keto-Coffee-Cake-Muffins-11.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Using a spoon, drizzle the sauce over top of the muffins.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-coffee-cake-muffins/#wprm-recipe-54579-step-0-11",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/Keto-Coffee-Cake-Muffins-12.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve and enjoy!",
